@host = http://localhost:5198
@token = paste-a-SalesRep-access-token-here

### Create an order — shop and quantities only (US-E4-1b resolves the rest)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "fulfilmentType": "ScheduledDelivery",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "quantity": 3 },
    { "productId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Immediate cash sale — served from the rep's van, lands in AwaitingCheckout
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "fulfilmentType": "ImmediateCashSale",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Q4: a client price is ignored — the stored price is Catalog's
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "fulfilmentType": "ScheduledDelivery",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 1 }
  ]
}

### List orders visible to the caller
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one order (includes the four verification steps)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### US-E4-3: check in at the shop (use the id of an AwaitingCheckout cash sale)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 6.8970,
  "longitude": 79.8556,
  "capturedAt": "2026-09-24T10:00:00+05:30",
  "accuracyMeters": 8
}

### US-E4-3: record the cash payment (amount must equal the order total)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2400.00,
  "method": "Cash"
}

### US-E4-5: agency approves a scheduled delivery (AgencyOperator token)
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approval
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approve"
}

### US-E4-5: agency rejects — reason is mandatory
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approval
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Reject",
  "reason": "Shop has an unpaid invoice from last month."
}

### US-E4-5: shop owner cancels inside the window (ShopOwner token; body optional)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Ordered the wrong pack size."
}
